<title>USA: Avecor says COO Glenn Taylor resigns.</title>
<headline>Avecor says COO Glenn Taylor resigns.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-01-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Avecor Cardiovascular Inc said Friday that Glenn Taylor had resigned as president and chief operating officer to pursue other business interests.</p>
<p>Chief Executive Anthony Badolato said the company intends to seek a replacement for Taylor and will look both inside and outside Avecor.</p>
<p>Avecor makes and markets medical devices for heart/lung bypass surgery and long-term respiratory support.</p>
<p>((-- Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
